  "details": "As a group organizer, I would find it very helpful to be able to show instance names prominently on the Group Activity page. Currently, my group runs lectures on avatar editing, and we generally have one main instance with the speaker, which is rebroadcast to other satellite instances. Today, we have to use different worlds with different thumbnails to distinguish these instances; if instance names were prominently visible, we could avoid splitting up the world like that.",
